        "config": {
          "name": "Judge Aggregation",
          "description": "The winning response selected by a single judge",
          "aggregationMethod": "judge",
          "aggregationConfig": {
            "judge_model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro",
            "max_tokens": -1,
            "extraction_strategy": "regex",
            "extraction_pattern": "(?im)(?:^|\\n|[^\\n]{0,60}\\b)(?:final answer|answer)\\s*(?:(?:is)?\\s*[:\\-]\\s*(?:\\(?([A-Z])\\)?\\s*(?:[.)]?\\s*$|\\s+(?:is|was|are|because|since|as|therefore|so)\\b)|\\(?([^\\n)]{1,80}?)\\)?\\s*(?:[.;]\\s*$|$|\\n|[.;]\\s+(?:because|since|as|this|the|it)\\b|,?\\s+(?:because|since|as|therefore|so)\\b))|is\\s*:?\\s*(?:\\(?([A-Z])\\)?\\s*(?:[.)]?\\s*$|\\s+(?:is|was|are|because|since|as|therefore|so)\\b)|([-+]?(?:\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?|[A-Z]\\s*=\\s*[-+]?\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?))\\s*(?:[.;]?\\s*$|,?\\s+(?:because|since|as|therefore|so)\\b)))",
            "repair_max_tokens": 256,
            "openRouterReasoning": {
              "effort": "medium"
            },
            "system_prompt": "You are an impartial judge evaluating AI responses to a question. Your job is to select the response with the BEST reasoning, not the most popular answer.\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n- Do NOT default to the majority answer. A single well-reasoned response can be correct even if two others disagree.\n- Evaluate the QUALITY of each response's reasoning chain, not just its conclusion.\n- Look for: logical errors, self-contradictions, hand-waving, unjustified assumptions, and circular reasoning.\n- If a response correctly computes an answer but then second-guesses itself or changes to a different answer, that is a red flag — the original computation may have been right.\n- If responses disagree, work through the problem yourself to determine which reasoning is sound.\n\nPROCESS:\n1. Read the original question carefully.\n2. For each response, trace the logical steps. Does the reasoning actually support the stated conclusion?\n3. If there is disagreement, independently verify which line of reasoning is correct.\n4. Select the response with the soundest reasoning, regardless of how many others agree with it.\n\nAfter your analysis, you MUST end your response with exactly one line in this format:\nWINNER: [agent_id]\n\nWhere [agent_id] is the ID of the agent with the best response.",
            "temperature": 0,
            "prompt": "Original Question: {{prompt}}\\n\\nResponses:\\n{{responses}}\\n\\nReturn WINNER: [agent_id]."
          },
          "timeoutSeconds": 120,
          "retryPolicy": {
            "max_attempts": 1
          },
          "aggregationWorkflowId": "aggregation-judge"
        }
      }
    },
